## Getting unstuck

- Lost on what a feature should do? → check `specs/` if it exists, or ask
- Lost on what's broken in code? → [audits/README.md](audits/README.md) if the audit ran
- Lost on a specific rule? → [.claude/rules.md](.claude/rules.md) or run `/x-rules <category>`
- Pre-commit hook blocking you? → fix the violation; bypass `git commit --no-verify` only in emergencies (the CI workflow will catch it anyway)

